  "id": "chicory-cups-with-avocado-and-pink-grapefruit-salsa",
  "name": "Chicory Cups with Avocado and Pink Grapefruit Salsa",
  "subtitle": "Crisp chicory leaves filled with bright citrus salsa",
  "description": "A fresh, no-cook appetizer combining creamy avocado, juicy pink grapefruit, chilli, coriander, lime, and olive oil in crisp chicory leaves.",
